{"id": "320729", "name": "קירוב פואסון לבינומית – גבול P(X_n ≤ 1) עבור Bin(n, k/n)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>תהא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left(X_n\\right)_{n=1}^\\infty\\)</span> סדרה של משתנים מקריים וידוע ש <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X_n\\sim\\mathsf{Bin}\\left(n,\\frac{{CT:0}}{n}\\right)\\)</span> לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n&gt; {{CT:0}}\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו את הגבול</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\displaystyle{\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\mathbb{P}\\left[ X_n\\leq1\\right]}\\]</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-e\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: את \\(e\\) מזינים <code dir=\"ltr\">e</code>, למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">2*e^(-5)</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> ההתפלגות הבינומית עם np קבוע מתכנסת להתפלגות פואסון (קירוב פואסון). מחשבים את הגבול של P[X_n=0] ושל P[X_n=1].</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הגבול של כל אחת מההסתברויות</b><br>כאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(np={{CT:0}}\\)</span>. משתמשים ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left(1-\\frac{ {{CT:0}} }{n}\\right)^n\\to e^{- {{CT:0}} }\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}[X_n=0]=\\left(1-\\frac{ {{CT:0}} }{n}\\right)^n\\xrightarrow[n\\to\\infty]{}e^{- {{CT:0}} } \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}[X_n=1]=n\\cdot\\frac{ {{CT:0}} }{n}\\left(1-\\frac{ {{CT:0}} }{n}\\right)^{n-1}\\xrightarrow[n\\to\\infty]{}{{CT:0}}\\,e^{- {{CT:0}} } \\]</p>(אלו ההסתברויות של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathsf{Poi}({{CT:0}})\\)</span> בנקודות 0 ו-1.)</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — הסכום</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\mathbb{P}[X_n\\le 1]=e^{- {{CT:0}} }+{{CT:0}}\\,e^{- {{CT:0}} }={{CT:1}}e^{- {{CT:0}} } \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["k", "ta"], "nvariants": 14}